  </div>
  <div class="about-body">
    <p>I’m Neil Kodner, a photographer based in Los Gatos, California.</p>
    <p>Hockey is the center of my work. I photograph college and NHL games in San Jose.</p>
    <p>Away from the rink I photograph cities and the people in them, mostly with a small camera, and aviation and birds when the chance comes.</p>
    <p>I’m looking for editorial assignments and team or league media work, in hockey above all.</p>

